{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03","cat":"favorite","group":{"id":"fav5016","label":"Poli"},"label":"Rookie Officer Poli's Relaxation Methods","stage":null,"prev":"treasurestory_poli_02","next":"treasurestory_poli_04","speakers":{"poli":"Poli"},"icons":{"poli":"si_c030_00_s"},"notes":["Favorite item quest step: Go to the Outpost"],"lines":[{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_1","text":"Oh, I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"NikkeRoom","bgArt":"nikkeroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_languor","movie":null,"shown":["poli"],"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_2","text":"So Quiry and Miranda went to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_3","text":"Grrr... They should be writing their reports like I told them to.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_4","text":"Then again, I should have expected as much from them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_5","text":"They told me you were upset.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_6","text":"Upset?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_7","text":"I'm not upset.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_8","text":"I simply wanted to be alone for a while.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_9","text":"If I hadn't put on a show of anger, I could have never gotten them off my tail.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_10","text":"Did something happen?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_11","text":"Nothing in particular.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_12","text":"I think I just haven't had much time to take a break as of late.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_13","text":"And it got me thinking about a lot of things.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_14","text":"It does sound like you needed a breather.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_15","text":"Hehe, I'm glad you agree with me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_16","text":"By the way, what's in that notebook?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_17","text":"Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_18","text":"Did Miranda and Quiry talk about the notebook too?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_19","text":"They did, yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_20","text":"Hmm... This notebook is...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_21","text":"You don't have to tell me if you don't want to.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_22","text":"No, it's fine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_23","text":"It's honestly not all that important, which somehow makes it more embarrassing to talk about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_24","text":"This is the notebook I used when I first became a police officer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_25","text":"Really?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_26","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_27","text":"Anyway, now that I've rested for a bit, I should head back and put their minds at ease.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_28","text":"Already? Are you sure you've rested long enough?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_29","text":"Not really, but it feels wrong to leave them stewing in their own discontent for this long.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_30","text":"... It hasn't even been 30 minutes since she left, so we can afford to leave Quiry and Miranda alone for a while yet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_31","text":"The fact you're taking this time off must mean you didn't have any pressing work today?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_32","text":"Yes, I already finished everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_33","text":"Unless something comes up, I have nothing else to do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_34","text":"Then how about we enjoy some R&R?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_35","text":"R&R?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_36","text":"Yeah, why not? Today should be dedicated to some well-deserved fun and relaxation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_37","text":"That may be true, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_38","text":"I'm not exactly well-versed in recreation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_39","text":"Being away from the station at this hour feels odd to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_40","text":"Besides, I'm worried about Quiry and Miranda.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_42","text":"Having said that... All right, I'm in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_43","text":"Let's go indulge in some R&R.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_44","text":"Are you sure?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_45","text":"Positive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_46","text":"Quiry and Miranda will be fine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_47","text":"They're both capable officers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_48","text":"And besides that, it's true that I am a bit worn out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_49","text":"I was flipping through the notebook earlier,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_50","text":"and as a rookie officer, I used to make sure to rest and have fun whenever I was going through a rough patch at work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_51","text":"It might be fun being the old Poli again for a while, as it were.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_52","text":"So there's more than just work notes in there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_53","text":"Given that it's a police notebook, its intended purpose was for work notes only. The fact there are personal entries shows how inexperienced I was then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_54","text":"Quite a bit different from how I am now, wouldn't you say?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_55","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_55","text":"Very much so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_56","text":"So, where did you used to go as a rookie officer to unwind?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_57","text":"Whenever work was getting to me,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_58","text":"it says that sweets are the go-to.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_59","text":"Follow me, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_poli_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_poli_03_60","text":"I'll lead the way!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}